WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.409 --> 00:00:03.231
打开 Rules / Open Rules

2
00:00:03.231 --> 00:00:06.217
新建 Guide first / Create Guide first

3
00:00:06.217 --> 00:00:09.017
填写 Host / Enter Host

4
00:00:09.017 --> 00:00:12.217
限制演示 Path / Restrict the example Path

5
00:00:12.217 --> 00:00:15.067
填写 x-guide-order / Enter x-guide-order

6
00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:17.867
启用当前规则 / Enable this Rule

7
00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:20.767
新建 Guide second / Create Guide second

8
00:00:20.767 --> 00:00:23.567
填写 Host / Enter Host

9
00:00:23.567 --> 00:00:26.777
限制演示 Path / Restrict the example Path

10
00:00:26.777 --> 00:00:29.617
填写 x-guide-order / Enter x-guide-order

11
00:00:29.617 --> 00:00:32.468
启用当前规则 / Enable this Rule

12
00:00:32.468 --> 00:00:35.317
应用两条规则 / Apply both Rules

13
00:00:35.317 --> 00:00:38.118
验证 second 后写覆盖 / Verify second wins initially

14
00:00:38.118 --> 00:00:41.068
把 second 拖到 first 前面 / Drag second before first

15
00:00:41.068 --> 00:00:43.918
Apply 新顺序 / Apply the new order

16
00:00:43.918 --> 00:00:46.669
验证 first 变为最后写入 / Verify first now wins

17
00:00:46.669 --> 00:00:49.567
新建 Guide rules 目录 / Create the Guide rules folder

18
00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:52.518
将 second 移入目录 / Move second into the folder

19
00:00:52.518 --> 00:00:55.425
将 first 移入目录 / Move first into the folder

20
00:00:55.425 --> 00:01:18.586
保存目录结构 / Apply the folder structure

21
00:01:18.586 --> 00:01:23.317
保存 guide-rules.json / Save guide-rules.json

22
00:01:23.317 --> 00:01:38.706
核对产品导出的规则树 / Verify the product-exported tree

23
00:01:38.706 --> 00:01:43.853
选择刚导出的规则 / Select the exported Rules file

24
00:01:43.853 --> 00:01:46.668
检查已启用规则的导入警告 / Inspect the enabled-rule import warning

25
00:01:46.668 --> 00:02:02.131
取消预览保持原树 / Cancel and retain the original tree

26
00:02:02.131 --> 00:02:07.165
重新选择同一文件 / Select the same file again

27
00:02:07.165 --> 00:02:10.369
确认追加，不覆盖 / Confirm append without overwrite
